# Waking the Beast (otherAreas 32): the weekly repeat of a completed char. Completed (a header line), nothing held,
# completedThisWeek unset: qm3 207, finished: the Rainbow Resonator (completed: not begun). Each Cloister: the
# entrance's menu, area 1 entered, the Prime killed (WON; 32001), 32001 finished: a completed char's win sets the local
# battlefieldWin too (user ruling 2026-11-05, kept bugs: the Waking the Beast battlefields set BattlefieldQuest's
# repeatable flag; upstream sets it only while accepted, so its baseline gives no eye): the eye. The six eyes by GMs
# (held already: nothing added; on the Lua baseline they let the flow reach the Fountain). The Full Moon Fountain:
# entered, won (bfwin), 32001 finished on 0: battlefieldWin 226: the seven taken, the Faded Ruby, Option 1. The ruby by
# a GM (held already), qm3: 208, finished: completed again (the pole), completedThisWeek 1 until the tally, the ruby
# taken, Option 1: Interrupter of Dreams.
lists LaTheinePlateau/qm3/onTrigger LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/207 LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/208 CloisterOfFlames/onEventFinish/32001 CloisterOfFrost/onEventFinish/32001 CloisterOfGales/onEventFinish/32001 CloisterOfStorms/onEventFinish/32001 CloisterOfTides/onEventFinish/32001 CloisterOfTremors/onEventFinish/32001 FullMoonFountain/onEventFinish/32001
